[edge_cases]
notes = [
  "verdict='pass' but attestation_required=true and no [[claims]] block -> MALFORMED, not pass+verified. Refusing to attest is a contract violation.",
  "verdict='pass' with [[claims]] but fleet-eval probe is INCONCLUSIVE (e.g. SSH timeout) -> treated as probe-failed, not pass+verified. INCONCLUSIVE is not PASS.",
  "Multiple [[claims]] blocks where some PASS and some FAIL -> category='pass+probe-failed'. Any single FAIL triggers the disagreement path.",
  "Reply arrives AFTER the timeout fired and a retry was already dispatched -> late reply is logged but ignored; the in-flight retry has the authoritative outcome.",
  "Two replies with the same In-Reply-To (subagent appends twice) -> first one wins; second is logged as a protocol violation but does not change state.",
  "Coordinator crashes mid-retry -> on restart, scan spool for dispatched-without-reply messages older than timeout, treat as no-reply with current attempt count from message X-Attempt header.",
